    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined cathedrals, hidden passageways, and crystal-covered landscapes as you face relentless enemies that will test your skill, precision, and strategy. Every battle is a challenge that rewards mastery, while exploration unveils fragments of a dark and fascinating story told through the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a unique artistic direction and a soundtrack that highlights mystery and tension, <i>Zenith</i> aims to immerse players in an experience that evokes emotions like solitude, triumph, and awe for the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face the darkness, push your limits, and uncover the secrets hidden in the shadows. Will you dare to take the first step?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Zenith a falled goddess</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383600/extras/824b0f12a005ac3b6a565d7715f4b9fc.avif?t=1755340587\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast spacing combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight different types of enemies and challenge your skills. From simple enemies to difficult bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get New Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Zenith you will get new gear and skills to help you get through the game\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up and Upgrade your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can custom your skills and upgrade your character to fit your needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Puzzles and get rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of puzzles to challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into a fascinating and Mysterious world full of secrets.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383600/extras/b81953f3569add52520bec2e07406df8.avif?t=1755340587\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined cathedrals, hidden passageways, and crystal-covered landscapes as you face relentless enemies that will test your skill, precision, and strategy. Every battle is a challenge that rewards mastery, while exploration unveils fragments of a dark and fascinating story told through the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a unique artistic direction and a soundtrack that highlights mystery and tension, <i>Zenith</i> aims to immerse players in an experience that evokes emotions like solitude, triumph, and awe for the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face the darkness, push your limits, and uncover the secrets hidden in the shadows. Will you dare to take the first step?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Zenith a falled goddess</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383600/extras/824b0f12a005ac3b6a565d7715f4b9fc.avif?t=1755340587\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast spacing combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight different types of enemies and challenge your skills. From simple enemies to difficult bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get New Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Zenith you will get new gear and skills to help you get through the game\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up and Upgrade your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can custom your skills and upgrade your character to fit your needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Puzzles and get rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of puzzles to challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into a fascinating and Mysterious world full of secrets.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383600/extras/b81953f3569add52520bec2e07406df8.avif?t=1755340587\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
